Every man is a person.
Every woman is a person.
Every person is a living-being.
A person who has a child is a parent.
If a parent X has a child Y and Y is a parent then X is a grandparent.
John is a man.
Mary is a woman.
Sue is a woman.
John has a child Mary.
Mary has a child Sue.
Bob is a man.
Bob has a child Tom.
Tom is a man.
Mary has a child Bob.
